BT /F1 10.2 Tf 0.07 0.16 0.23 rg 1 0 0 1 50 676.0 Tm (The optional journal records metadata updates and permits quicker repair after an unsafe) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 0.07 0.16 0.23 rg 1 0 0 1 50 659.0 Tm (shutdown. Apple's technical note makes clear that the journal is for volume structures,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 0.07 0.16 0.23 rg 1 0 0 1 50 642.0 Tm (not a guarantee of full user-data persistence. Journal replay must preserve transaction) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 0.07 0.16 0.23 rg 1 0 0 1 50 625.0 Tm (order and issue flushes before advancing the journal start pointer.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 0.07 0.16 0.23 rg 1 0 0 1 50 595.0 Tm (A full checker validates catalog and extents tree nodes, CNIDs, link counts, allocation) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 0.07 0.16 0.23 rg 1 0 0 1 50 578.0 Tm (ownership, journal state and fork extents. Duplicate or orphaned metadata-directory) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 0.07 0.16 0.23 rg 1 0 0 1 50 561.0 Tm (entries and mismatched attribute records need special handling. Journal existence does not) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.2 Tf 0.07 0.16 0.23 rg 1 0 0 1 50 544.0 Tm (eliminate the possibility of damaged metadata or lost data during storage faults.) Tj ET
